WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Download the extension ZIP. Open the latest GitHub release and choose EZEapply.zip.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Find it. Unzip it. Keep the folder. In Downloads, double-click EZEapply.zip to extract EZEapply.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Open Chrome’s extension manager. Go to chrome://extensions and switch Developer mode on.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Choose Load unpacked. Chrome opens a folder picker. Select the extracted EZEapply folder.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.500
Select the folder with manifest.json. Choose the EZEapply folder itself, then click Select.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.000
You’re ready. Open EZEapply. Pin it in Chrome’s Extensions menu. Open your profile and start applying.
